2026-07-27T08:13:40.3633429Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:13:40.3634057Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:13:40.3635049Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:13:40.3636018Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:13:40.3636728Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
